  "body": "### Summary\nAs a maintainer, I want the image upload client tested on real host answers, so that a change of the host's JSON is caught.\n\n### Scope\nPR #394 captured `U01` (200 \"file uploaded\", `image.thumb.url` with `.th.`, `image.medium` present with every field null, numbers as JSON numbers) and `U02` (HTTP 400, `error.message` \"Invalid API key.\", code 100). Make `RehostClientTests` decode both; a null medium must give no medium URL, the 400 must surface the host's message.\n\n### Depends on\n#394. Not a Mac task.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Tests read U01 and U02 and fail if the decoding regresses.",
